{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-03/1065754/block/singleImage/3278272/wm/01KKGNCZJZ79Z54EY2MJFDYAZV.JPG?updatedAt=1795616454\"/><figcaption>HK Express明年1月開辦往返南通直航。(資料圖片／蘇文傑攝)</figcaption></figure><p>香港快運航空(HK Express)明年1月29日起，開辦往返香港和江蘇省南通市的直飛航線，每周四對直航航班往返南通興東國際機場。南通是HK Express繼無錫、常州之後在江蘇省的第三個航點，亦是整個華東網絡的第五個航點。 HK Express指，新航線將於逢周一、五、日早上9時35分，以及逢周三早上9時40分從香港出發，航班編號UO296，預計11時55分抵達當地；回程航班UO297則逢周一、三、五、日中午12時50分從南通出發，下午3時25分抵達香港。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T15:43:56.346501+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":266,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T14:20:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T23:50:53.051725+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T15:37:17.428332+00:00","content_hash":"e94924eca2b329e6f9988bd55547dfdd4395babfa24e0783fe2f4ac6e6ce2ddb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}